# Como Lake 2027 — Registration & Games Management (OARS)

> 🎯 Project pivoted to the **World Masters Sport / Como Lake 2027** RFP (REV-022). This app is being revised from an old athlete-only POC into **two responsive portals** (Participant + Admin "OC Command Centre") driven by a configurable **Masters rules engine**. The stack/architecture rules below still apply; scope comes from the Como docs.

